  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.biology_basics": "生物常识",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.biology_basics.desc": "动植物标本采集、组织取样与野外博物记录的基础常识。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.natural_history": "博物学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.natural_history.desc": "系统分类与记录野生动植物的栖息群系、食性与繁衍习性。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.microscopy": "显微观察",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.microscopy.desc": "利用光学玻璃磨制物镜与目镜，制造显微镜与载玻片观察微观世界。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.cell_biology": "细胞学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.cell_biology.desc": "借显微镜辨识动植物与微生物细胞结构，读取菌株名与纯度。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.microbiology": "微生物学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.microbiology.desc": "配制琼脂培养基并在恒温培养箱内分离纯化细菌与真菌菌株。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.botany": "植物学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.botany.desc": "研究植物形态、科属分类与药用部位。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.zoology": "动物学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.zoology.desc": "研究动物解剖习性、驯养条件与可采集组织。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.ecology": "生态学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.ecology.desc": "通过样方调查评估群系生物多样性指数与生态承载力。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.genetics": "遗传学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.genetics.desc": "揭示作物性状分离与遗传规律，读取种质库基因型参数。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.plant_breeding": "育种",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.plant_breeding.desc": "建造育种台与种质库，通过定向杂交选育高产耐逆优良品种。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.biochemistry": "生物化学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.biochemistry.desc": "解析糖酵解、酶促催化与生物大分子分离提纯工艺。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.industrial_fermentation": "工业发酵",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.industrial_fermentation.desc": "建造受控不锈钢发酵罐，利用纯培养菌株大批量生产抗生素、乙醇与酶制剂。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.molecular_biology": "分子生物学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.molecular_biology.desc": "研究核酸与蛋白质的分子机制及遗传信息传递。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.genomics": "基因组学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.genomics.desc": "利用基因测序仪与 PCR 扩增仪测定基因型并提取特定性状 DNA 模板。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.manual_sequencing": "手工测序（自研）",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.manual_sequencing.desc": "在缺乏数字计算机辅助时，依靠电泳与显影纸手工比对读取碱基序列。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.genetic_engineering": "基因工程",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.genetic_engineering.desc": "建造基因编辑台，将 DNA 模板定向写入种子或菌株以重塑性状。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.life_science_mastery": "生命科学精研",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.bio.life_science_mastery.desc": "贯通宏观生态、工业发酵与分子基因工程，使生物学造物臻至传世品阶。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.anatomy": "解剖学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.anatomy.desc": "系统掌握人体骨骼、肌肉与脏器结构，为临床诊断与外科手术奠基。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.physiology": "生理学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.physiology.desc": "研究血液循环、呼吸代谢与体温调节机制。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.diagnostics": "诊断学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.diagnostics.desc": "运用听诊器、体温计与病历夹精确测量体征并建立临床档案。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.laboratory_medicine": "检验医学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.laboratory_medicine.desc": "结合显微镜、诊断箱与血液检验盒开展体液与病原化验。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.infectious_disease": "感染病学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.infectious_disease.desc": "辨析细菌、真菌与病毒感染的致病机理、病程阶段与用药方案。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.antibiotics": "抗生素",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.antibiotics.desc": "以青霉菌纯培养发酵并离心精制青霉素，高效清除细菌感染。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.broad_spectrum_antibiotics": "广谱抗生素",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.broad_spectrum_antibiotics.desc": "工业化发酵制备链霉素、四环素、氯霉素与万古霉素以应对顽固感染。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.antivirals_antifungals": "抗病毒与抗真菌",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.antivirals_antifungals.desc": "研制抗真菌剂与抗病毒剂，清除深部真菌感染并缩短病毒病程。",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.immunology": "免疫学",
  "lore.earth_life_sciences.med.immunology.desc": "掌握减毒疫苗培育与免疫调控原理，预防破伤风等烈性传染病。",
